#: d61108ff79514410b631c9ac8d61246a
msgid "ArduPilot Custom Firmware Builder"
msgstr "ArduPilot 自定义固件构建器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:7
#: 1a12c742d83540668a438aabc08b6728 393b7eef79e14ccdb74d87cfc6d14c9b
#: 52ce44528110409abefdec850481ecf4 59b3ddeb015a49129733e58f18767885
#: 677cefd74a9b434da3fc50d4ae2b17bc eaa0c7f8aebc4815ab611405a0a713db
#: eab07f7ffa2947a1a3a2a018c79c0f9f
msgid ""
"As the ArduPilot software evolves through community contributions and "
"development efforts, it’s expanding rapidly with many new features being "
"added. However, not all users need every feature. Depending on their "
"specific requirements and applications, users might prefer to exclude "
"certain features from the software."
msgstr ""
"随着 ArduPilot "
"软件通过社区贡献和开发工作不断发展，它正在迅速扩展并增加了许多新功能。然而，并非所有用户都需要每个功能。根据其具体需求和应用，用户可能希望从软件中排除某些功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-custom-firmware.rst:9
#: 004e4cf3f19d44efa3f772c85ccd0f43 29260d1170004c078e559345baaf333c
#: 4afc093462de49299f82b965adbc3269 5020a2eca10f46828966f2f9be48803a
#: 78a19f5638b84569bd49ff959442b4e4 96577b09edfe42ac9f100178af96e41a
#: e66d3291c4c44c29973b983503ecd58f
msgid ""
"To address this need, we have developed the **Custom Firmware Builder**, a "
"web application hosted at `custom.ardupilot.org "
"<https://custom.ardupilot.org/>`__. This process helps in reducing the "
"firmware size, making it easier to fit into flight control units (FCUs) with"
" limited flash memory. It also benefits our testers, allowing them to test "
"specific features without needing to upgrade their flight controllers due to"
" space constraints."
msgstr ""
"为满足这一需求，我们开发了 **自定义固件构建器**，这是一个托管在 `custom.ardupilot.org "
"<https://custom.ardupilot.org/>`__ 的 Web 应用程序。这一过程有助于减小固件大小，使其更容易适配 Flash "
"内存有限的飞控（FCU）。它也有益于我们的测试人员，使他们能够测试特定功能，而无需因空间限制而升级飞控。"

