#: f782fc77ae4149b59e52814a693fa8ea
msgid ""
"the exact numbers of bytes will change slightly over time due to code "
"changes, but this table should be accurate enough to make decisions on "
"removal candidates to gain flash space."
msgstr "确切的字节数会随代码更改而略有变化，但此表应足够准确，可用于决定移除哪些候选项以获得 Flash 空间。"

